      "versionNonce": 813319908,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749481964703,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "done\n\nCRON JOB 9:16 AM IST NODE.JS PROCESS, CACHE TO REDIS AND EXPIRY 9:15 AM IST\nBACKEND FIX THE GET OPTIONS DATA EXPIRY AND LIST OF INDICES\nCOMPLETE FE ADD STATERGY AND PLACE ORDER TRADEINFO CRUD INTERGRATION IN FE\nfe sticky\nCOMPLETE PYTHON LATEST INFO UPDATER TO THE REDIS STREAM\nSETUP PUBSUB AND REDIS STREAM\nmain node.js pubsub messger\ndb fix\nfrontend fix for api key crud operation\nbackend - api routes for crud(api key)\nlive price to core services (first fix) \nbackend-api routes for get,put,create,delete api credentials\nbackend - api -get position info\nbackend create,read,update position info (1 hr max)]\ncore service - getprice from wss \ncore-service -get data from redis stream\nredis stream consumers - core service \nget api key for live price fe service using db credentials\nget api key for live price for core service using db credentials\nnode.js live Position price for core service - few fixes\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ljPsY72Z7-Ms06YJKVech",
      "originalText": "done\n\nCRON JOB 9:16 AM IST NODE.JS PROCESS, CACHE TO REDIS AND EXPIRY 9:15 AM IST\nBACKEND FIX THE GET OPTIONS DATA EXPIRY AND LIST OF INDICES\nCOMPLETE FE ADD STATERGY AND PLACE ORDER TRADEINFO CRUD INTERGRATION IN FE\nfe sticky\nCOMPLETE PYTHON LATEST INFO UPDATER TO THE REDIS STREAM\nSETUP PUBSUB AND REDIS STREAM\nmain node.js pubsub messger\ndb fix\nfrontend fix for api key crud operation\nbackend - api routes for crud(api key)\nlive price to core services (first fix) \nbackend-api routes for get,put,create,delete api credentials\nbackend - api -get position info\nbackend create,read,update position info (1 hr max)]\ncore service - getprice from wss \ncore-service -get data from redis stream\nredis stream consumers - core service \nget api key for live price fe service using db credentials\nget api key for live price for core service using db credentials\nnode.js live Position price for core service - few fixes\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
