      "seed": 730776777,
      "version": 1180,
      "versionNonce": 1094100708,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749473087773,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "live price to core services\n\n\n\nget trade data from stream \n \nfrom the data get the required option\nlive price and have them in memory\n\n\ntrack the index price, if the price is\nhigher than the point adjustment lower\nor upper limit update the required\noption live price and have them in\nmemory (only applies when the entry\nprice is triggered)\n\nthe core service connects using\nsocket.io and emit the all price data\nto the core services on update\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "GkRUMULi1tp7nx_lTe_X2",
      "originalText": "live price to core services\n\n\n\nget trade data from stream \n \nfrom the data get the required option live price and have them in memory\n\n\ntrack the index price, if the price is higher than the point adjustment lower or upper limit update the required option live price and have them in memory (only applies when the entry price is triggered)\n\nthe core service connects using socket.io and emit the all price data to the core services on update\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QuhLXl6hW1zl6EJjVDoKL",
