      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "node .js live price data (required changes)\n\ncalculatate required options price and store them in a global variable\neg: [{id:\"\",optionName : \"\", price:\"\"}]\n\nwhen the price changes update the global price variable using id \nwhen the price changes push the change with option name & price to core\nservices\n\nwhen the user updates the add or remove entry, then calculate  the required\noption price and remove the old data from the global variable \n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "QuhLXl6hW1zl6EJjVDoKL",
      "originalText": "node .js live price data (required changes)\n\ncalculatate required options price and store them in a global variable\neg: [{id:\"\",optionName : \"\", price:\"\"}]\n\nwhen the price changes update the global price variable using id \nwhen the price changes push the change with option name & price to core services\n\nwhen the user updates the add or remove entry, then calculate  the required option price and remove the old data from the global variable \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
